															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									A dark romance SRPG. Pledge your life to feisty and unhinged monstergirls, then defeat your foes using careful positioning and strategical wit. From the downtrodden rise a revolting mafia; join them in a wild hunt for power, revenge, change... and love.								</div>
