								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >• <strong>Turn-Based Tactics</strong>: Fight your way through danger, using positioning and strategy to come out on top    <br>• <strong>Dark Romance</strong>: Form intimate bonds with wild, ravenous monstergirls: lamia, kitsune, harpies, manticore and more                        <br>• <strong>RPG</strong>: Between battles, make decisions about romantic relationships: Branching paths and choices with consequences      <br>• <strong><u>Zero Generative AI</u>:</strong> Writing, editing, coding, design, everything, all done by hand with care and attention!    <br>• Demo progress carries over into the full game! </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/4c19ea4d6380cd89363ca83f5efcabd1.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/4c19ea4d6380cd89363ca83f5efcabd1.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >  <span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/59503a517015c2903e3496ea791719e4.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=430 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/59503a517015c2903e3496ea791719e4.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span><strong>Turn-Based</strong> <strong>Tactics</strong><br>        • Player/Enemy phase turns <i>(like Fire Emblem)   </i> <br>        • Position-based follow-up attacks <i>(like Triangle Strategy)  </i><br><strong>Form Your Squad</strong><br>        • Meet new monstergirls<strong>,</strong> then recruit them to deploy them in battle    <br>        • ...Or hire them to earn you gold, losing a unit, but allowing you to purchase powerful combat items    </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/67b366908cb3e72a60ce43d6f49a459f.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/67b366908cb3e72a60ce43d6f49a459f.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span>• <strong>Unique abilities for all characters</strong> — spew fire, boost your movement, block off chokepoints, <span class="bb_strike">lose control and attack your allies</span>, sneak behind enemy lines, and  more    <br>• Unique permanent upgrades for all characters    <br>• A wide variety of items; equip them creatively to make up for your squad's weaknesses    <br>• Modify the terrain, using the battlefield  to your advantage</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/3ff7f48e7fcdaa2e6e990fcb7f4aefd8.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/3ff7f48e7fcdaa2e6e990fcb7f4aefd8.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >• Every battle is unique, with varying objectives   <br>• No XP or leveling, no height mechanic    <br>• Customizable Difficulty   <br>        • Add permadeath, disable follow-up attacks, and more. Tune the challenge to your comfort level!  <br>• Custom-tuned game engine designed for mouse and keyboard   <br>        • Less time navigating menus made for console players, more time making strategic and tactical decisions   <br>        • If you're a Steam Deck user, pretend I didn't say that   <br>• All battles can be instantly skipped, for those who want to focus on the story and monstergirls</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/40257366707ceeb11b12793e540b98c0.avif?t=1794632586" alt="story" width=787 height=100 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/91d8094ea7865286cc199c15eddaef39.avif?t=1794632586" width=1404 height=336 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>After a century of torture, the Devoures finally execute you.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Death. It is a mercy.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You’re forced to jump into Oubliette, the enormous fissure in the ground that separates the elfen plateau from the rest of the continent. This is where they toss their trash — useless junk, broken gear, and people like you — to dispose of.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You fall, and fall...</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >When you hit the bottom, you’ll know freedom at last.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/850531adc0b4dc5dd81baca6396b3a46.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=228 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/850531adc0b4dc5dd81baca6396b3a46.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >...But instead of the endless abyss, you wake in the woods to find a flitty fox girl standing over you, her palms awash with healing sorcery.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >This kitsune woman is not an otherworldly deity, nor a spirit of the forest; she is simply a gifted sorceress, a fellow condemned criminal, and your mortal savior.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >In gratitude, you pledge her your servitude.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >She will make good use of it. Your new fluffy-tailed leader has unearthed natural riches granting power beyond belief, and holds grand ambitions. To see them through, she’ll need allies she can depend on.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/57d258cb43a1cd8c44a6f41737656020.avif?t=1794632586" width=1404 height=336 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fight for freedom, mingle with the mafia, and change the continent forever.<br>Serve your kitsune as she takes you on a path of underhanded glory.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Along the way, encounter a variety of feisty monstergirls — lamia, arachne, harpies, tanuki, manticore and more — all with their own goals. Will they become friend, foe... or soulmate?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/4c19ea4d6380cd89363ca83f5efcabd1.poster.avif?t=1794632586" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/4c19ea4d6380cd89363ca83f5efcabd1.mp4?t=1794632586" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/7fc466958d29b2498cbc0387d09c15ec.avif?t=1794632586" alt="meet the criminals" width=787 height=100 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/9c1962591671e52f72a7b432982dd57f.webp?t=1794632586" alt="hana" width=150 height=39 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A clever kitsune gifted in sorcery and tread on by the world.<br>She seeks to leverage her newfound fortune to reform the continent.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/b2cc96d7479366cc1c0e156c5c439fd7.webp?t=1794632586" alt="deiza" width=150 height=39 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">Once the leader of a brutal mercenary clan terrorizing the land, she alone survived execution after capture.<br>This lamia lies now dormant, defeated in spirit, numbly aiding Hana's ambitions.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/3e0f28c8c8ca24a734424102a3b8505b.webp?t=1794632586" alt="aichi" width=150 height=42 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">An arachne. Sadistic and unrepentant, she truly deserved her execution. <br>But it matters not. They threw you into the same hole; now, you're of the same kin.   <br>Those in a hole must join, or die.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/107805e2befc5a686b16719fa72d7f37.webp?t=1794632586" alt="yowl" width=150 height=45 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A crass bloodbath bird who loves nothing more than hurting other people.<br>Scarily talented in wetwork; her talons tell the tale.  <br>She must have had a legendary mentor.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/02e01997976fe3d9c1796ea8a4e42c04.webp?t=1794632586" alt="infri" width=150 height=44 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">Hana's close friend, though they've been long separated. <br>In recent years, Infri has been rising in popularity among the continent's largest crime network.   <br>This succubus is your in with the underground.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/9bca978ab54dc9388e3a6d9acd42b129.webp?t=1794632586" alt="josephine" width=205 height=58 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">Once of your former elfen clan, she is now a fellow turncoat, helping you fight against them. <br>Suffers from the most dangerous delusion.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/70cffec5504c9fe11fd83a4058f3eba6.webp?t=1794632586" alt="alikina" width=150 height=43 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">Betrayed by her old master, this peculiar maid seeks a new deity to worship. <br>As a fallen angel, she's an unskilled warrior, but people can change in surprising ways...</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/212caa475de53b5615e6bd52005f0ae0.webp?t=1794632586" alt="mirzee" width=150 height=39 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A powerful, seasoned manticore from a foreign nation.<br>She won't say what she's doing in this land — but you can take an educated guess.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/c3d0f67a4f2bc3e5d24c05b413dd63c4.webp?t=1794632586" alt="mongo" width=150 height=48 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A huge, muscular lioness who rarely speaks.<br>Does she even understand your words?<br>Gazes at you rather oddly. Best keep your distance.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/a0dcb6cb04b681f4ec2b06f509b350f2.webp?t=1794632586" alt="taffu" width=150 height=44 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A cute frog, desperate for opportunities to earn gold. <br>He has no ambitions beyond finding safe, stable, and lucrative work. <br>Er, safety optional.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/43b67b758a8a9fca1091d3522684f7a0.webp?t=1794632586" alt="zonie" width=150 height=39 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">A bratty mafia boss and a greedy tanuki.<br>Esteemed for her unrivaled smuggling skills, but unpopular otherwise, for... many reasons. <br>Utterly unhinged. Don't talk to her.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960970/extras/2b02f9aebee2e41a3499f74d1e06fae4.webp?t=1794632586" alt="you" width=150 height=39 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center">It's you! A former forced member of the continent's most secretive organization, you were condemned after...<br>Ghh... Your head, it hurts...</p>						</div>
					</div>
